	METHOD method_4119 writeAtomically (Ljava/io/File;Lcom/xk72/util/class_1542;)V
		COMMENT Runs the writer against a "charles" temp file beside the destination, keeping its extension, then Files.move()s it over the destination with ATOMIC_MOVE, falling back to REPLACE_EXISTING. The temp file is deleted on any failure.
		ARG 0 file
		ARG 1 writer
