	METHOD method_4124 readFully (Ljava/io/InputStream;[B)I
		COMMENT Reads until the buffer is full or the stream ends, returning how many bytes landed. A single InputStream.read is allowed to return short, which is what this exists to paper over.
		ARG 0 inputStream
		ARG 1 buffer
